            "review_title": "Review at Nem nuong Thanh Van",
            "review_text": "Jimbolio\nSydney, Australia126 contributions\n0\nGreat food and service - well worth a visit\nDec 2024 • Couples\nWe enjoyed excellent service and food at Nem nuong Thanh Van this evening. Simple, tasty, fresh food, beautifully spiced and seasoned. We were seated straight away although the restaurant was very busy, our order was taken, and our food and drinks arrived promptly. The lady serving us was very pleasant and attentive. We really enjoyed eating here.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nSpring rolls are very good here.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 29, 2025",
