            "review_text": "ML991\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia203 contributions\n0\nOk but overrated\nMay 2019 • Family\nOrdered the pork set (50k) and spring roll. Food came promptly and server made hand signals on how to eat the rice wrap. Flavour is tasty but my expectations are higher. \nDuring payment, we were charged more so I told another server our orders. Then she went to the cashier and gave us our correct change. \nThe restaurant can improve its image if the servers do not push all rubbish from the tables to the floor. After accumulation of rubbish, a staff swept the rubbish off the floor and mopped the floor.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 21, 2019",
