            "review_text": "Steven D\nAntwerp, Belgium51 contributions\n0\nGreat food!!!\nDec 2018 • Couples\nWe stayed in Vietnam (& Cambodia) for 3,5 weeks, and this place served us the best food on our entire trip, hands down. They only have 4 dishes, of which we tasted 3. Their spring rolls are absolutely amazing! None of the other places we visited, lots claiming to have the best spring rolls, came even close.\nOn top of being the best food, it was also our cheapest meal during the entire trip. A total of 8 spring rolls, 2 other dishes, plus 2 soda's (we were with 2) cost us 126'000 VND, which is 5 EUR.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 26, 2018",
